    "name": "Study Abroad 101 | Take Your Goals Global!",
    "type": "Academic",
    "location_id": "loc_virtual",
    "community_id": "com_columbia_general",
    "description": "&lt;p&gt;Interested in studying abroad but not sure where to start? Attend this &lt;strong&gt;Study Abroad 101 | Finding Your Program, Group Advising&lt;/strong&gt; session to learn more about the program types, application process, financial considerations, and academic credits while abroad. Discover insights into other cultures and develop new perspectives while continuing to work towards your personal, academic, and professional goals!&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Join us on &lt;strong&gt;Friday, September 5th, 2025, from 12:00 PM - 1:00 PM&lt;/strong&gt;, for a virtual session via Zoom to learn more about narrowing down your study abroad options!&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Even if you are unable to attend, we encourage you to register since it will ensure you receive a recording to view at your convenience.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zoom link: &lt;a href=\"https://columbiauniversity.zoom.us/j/97105558994?pwd=QmpiZHNPcmVqUlVjcnhHejlsblRxUT09\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;https://columbiauniversity.zoom.us/j/97105558994?pwd=QmpiZHNPcmVqUlVjcnhHejlsblRxUT09&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
