    "community_id": "com_columbia_general",
    "description": "&lt;p&gt;Are you a Computer Science student interested in studying abroad? Attend this virtual alumni panel on &lt;strong&gt;Tuesday, September 9th at 5:00 PM ET&lt;/strong&gt; to hear first-hand experiences from students who earned credit towards their Computer Science degrees while studying abroad in beautiful Siena, Italy, with CET Academic Programs!&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Even if you are unable to attend, we encourage you to register with CET since it will&amp;nbsp;ensure you receive a recording to view at your convenience.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please visit the &lt;a href=\"https://global.undergrad.columbia.edu/\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Center for Undergraduate Global Engagement&amp;#39;s&lt;/a&gt; website to learn more about the &lt;a href=\"https://global.undergrad.columbia.edu/program/cet-siena-computer-science\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;CET Siena: Computer Science&lt;/a&gt; program, application process, and eligibility requirements. If you have any questions, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=\"mailto:uge@columbia.edu\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;uge@columbia.edu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;",
