    "community_id": "com_columbia_general",
    "description": "&lt;p&gt;In this 20 minute session, you will get a better understanding of the University&amp;#39;s health insurance requirement, the waiver request process, eligibility criteria, and how to submit a waiver request. Q&amp;amp;A to follow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=\"https://columbiahealth.zoom.us/webinar/register/2917504344516/WN_RrOHvDW9TTehJeqwLd5gzQ\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Register on Zoom.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This session is for Morningside/Manhattanville and Teachers College students who are currently enrolled in the Columbia University Student Health Insurance Plan, as well as new incoming students interested in enrolling in the plan during the open enrollment period.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;hr /&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Columbia Health makes every effort to accommodate individuals with disabilities. If you require accommodations to attend this event, contact Disability Services at disability@columbia.edu at least 5 days in advance of the event.&lt;/p&gt;",
