    "description": "&lt;p&gt;From 12:00 PM - 4:00 PM our CU Well Peer Leaders are hanging out at the Lerner Ramps! They are well-versed on information about health &amp;amp; well-being resources provided by Alice! Health Promotion and Columbia Health. Stop by to chat, get connected to Columbia Health resources, learn about ways to get involved, or just to grab any of our well-being freebies (snacks, sleep kits, sticky-note books, foldaway tote bags, lip balm).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Interested in getting involved? We recruit for CU Well Peer Leaders each Spring term, applications open in March. Learn more on the &lt;a href=\"https://www.health.columbia.edu/content/student-employment-and-volunteer-opportunities\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Student Employment and Volunteer&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=\"https://www.health.columbia.edu/content/student-employment-and-volunteer-opportunities\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Opportunities Page&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
