    "description": "&lt;p&gt;Join us for town hall event featuring Dr. Anil Rustgi, director of the HICCC, and the HICCC leadership. Hear the latest updates from across the HICCC and learn about our programs and resources, including Research Programs, pilot funding, shared resources, community outreach and engagement, education and training, clinical trials, and more.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join using Zoom:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=\"https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcolumbiacuimc.zoom.us%2Fj%2F98062087107%3Fpwd%3DODN1TFwbtR23dO0Pk7Bq73td7fG91L.1&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cpk2851%40cumc.columbia.edu%7C10c656e248bf42d2fb2208ddcf936789%7Cb0002a9b0017404d97dc3d3bab09be81%7C0%7C0%7C638894954185778018%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=a1PsUo8mGHQDocd2eWiamhCFJpktCPNp%2BslMJlcnNSI%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;https://columbiacuimc.zoom.us/j/98062087107?pwd=ODN1TFwbtR23dO0Pk7Bq73td7fG91L.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\n&lt;br /&gt;\nMeeting ID: 980 6208 7107&lt;br /&gt;\nPasscode: 267022&lt;/p&gt;",
