    "description": "&lt;p&gt;The first step when learning to program can be intimidating. Where to begin? How to find tutorials? Where can you practice and when does it become fun? In this hands-on workshop we&amp;#39;ll try out the basics of Python coding and introduce you to resources that fit your learning style. You&amp;#39;ll code along with the instructor, ask questions along the way, and leave with some next steps to continue your programming journey.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Attendees are encouraged to bring a laptop.&lt;/p&gt;",
