    "community_id": "com_columbia_general",
    "description": "&lt;p&gt;Learn how to solve problems like a computer! In this beginner level workshop, we will use real-life examples and games to break down problems into smaller parts, find patterns in the pieces, and rebuild it into a step-by-step solution. By the end of the workshop, we will build an algorithm to solve a maze with a drag and drop programming tool.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Attendees are encouraged, but not required, to bring a laptop.&lt;/p&gt;",
